/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!has_version(NAME)` and
 * `__pragma!version_value(NAME)` constructs.
 *
 * The first tells at compile time whether a version is set, the second reads
 * the value a version was given, `-fversion=NAME=VALUE`.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::version
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/version.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-11-04
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
